{"code":"330350","name":"위더스제약","market":"KOSDAQ","sector_name":"제약","sector_desc":"의약품을 개발·생산·판매. 신약 파이프라인과 임상 결과, 약가 정책에 주가가 크게 반응합니다.","desc":"동사는 2004년 대덕약품공업주식회사로 설립되었고 2007년 위더스제약으로 상호를 변경했으며, 2020년 코스닥시장에 상장함. 전문의약품 생산 및 판매를 주요 사업으로 하며, 고령화와 만성질환을 목표로 순환기계, 근골격계, 소화기계, 항생제, 중추신경계 의약품을 생산하고 있음. 특히 순환기용제에 강점이 있으며, 세팔로스포린계 항생제 전용 생산시설을 갖추어 1~3세대 생산라인을 구축하고 있음.","f":{"date":"2026-10-19","n_days":298,"close":6990.0,"open":6780.0,"high":7150.0,"low":6780.0,"volume":30889,"amount":215914110.0,"ret_1d":3.4024,"gap":0.2959,"range_pct":5.2933,"ret_5":1.0116,"ret_20":-7.6618,"ret_60":11.84,"ret_120":-28.3811,"ret_250":0.431,"ma20":7090.5,"ma60":7274.3333,"ma120":7367.5833,"ma200":7865.7,"close_vs_ma200":-11.1331,"close_vs_ma60":-3.9087,"ma_align":0,"cross_ma200_20d":0.0,"slope_60":30.3162,"r2_60":0.0378,"slope_120":-21.0205,"r2_120":0.0755,"slope_250":-2.9041,"r2_250":0.0041,"high52":11950.0,"low52":5910.0,"pos_52w":17.8808,"dd_52w":-41.5063,"mdd_1y":-49.665,"atr14_pct":4.6495,"vol_ann_60":71.562,"vol_avg20":69657.2,"vol_ratio20":0.4434,"vr5":0.1078,"vr20":0.131,"amount_avg5":351968138.0,"amount_avg20":497498080.0,"amount_avg60":3526444974.1667,"obv_chg20":-60.669,"turnover_20":10.5544,"pv_eff_20":-0.7259,"rsi14":46.9361,"frgn_net_5":85491.0,"inst_net_5":5.0,"frgn_net_5_pct":0.6477,"inst_net_5_pct":0.0,"smart_net_5_pct":0.6477,"frgn_net_20":185884.0,"inst_net_20":16.0,"frgn_net_20_pct":1.4082,"inst_net_20_pct":0.0001,"smart_net_20_pct":1.4084,"frgn_net_60":93237.0,"inst_net_60":26213.0,"frgn_net_60_pct":0.7064,"inst_net_60_pct":0.1986,"smart_net_60_pct":0.9049,"frgn_net_120":-439113.0,"inst_net_120":26171.0,"frgn_net_120_pct":-3.3267,"inst_net_120_pct":0.1983,"smart_net_120_pct":-3.1284,"foreign_ratio":2.02,"foreign_ratio_chg_60":0.83,"smart_buy_streak":6,"op_income_q":11.0,"op_margin_q":3.7801,"op_qoq":450.0,"op_turnaround":0.0,"op_yoy":37.5,"rev_yoy":11.0687,"op_trend_4q":-20.4878,"fin_period":"202606","roe":7.96,"debt_ratio":38.57,"per":11.59,"pbr":0.89,"div_yield":n